  "body": "In section 6, under the \"To create a HID report item\" part, step 9 is:\n\n> Set reportItem[\"[hasPreferredState](https://hid.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-hidreportitem-haspreferredstate)\"] to bitfield[5].\n\nBut the HID spec, section 6.2.2.4 specifies that bit 5 = 0 means Preferred State and 1 means No Preferred State. So this should instead be\n\n> Set reportItem[\"[hasPreferredState](https://hid.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-hidreportitem-haspreferredstate)\"] to !bitfield[5].\n\nNote that Blink [does this correctly](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:third_party/blink/renderer/modules/hid/hid_device.cc;l=586;drc=557d18d6e337bab85172345226da54e2f770682b), so I think this is just a typo in the spec.",
